{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Love Letter!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your name is Ai and your only goal in life is to deliver your confession letter to the boy of your dreams: Tokio. Except he\u2019s nowhere to be found and the whole school is frozen in time! You\u2019ll have to unlock doors, solve puzzles, help students and confront your feelings in order to reach Tokio - and his heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Students in trouble!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help students who are in trouble throughout school! Building your friendships grants you unique items (called HeartLinks) that help you solve puzzles and unlock new areas of the school.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>HeartLinks!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each HeartLink gives you a unique ability to bend reality and time! Freeze time, swap materials, throw knives, and run really freaking fast! Every new item is a new way to solve puzzles and discover new parts of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1643800?t=1758320705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1643800?t=1758320705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/ce3936d313b50a85d1296db71e900d08c96d7349/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758320705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/ce3936d313b50a85d1296db71e900d08c96d7349/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758320705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3983660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Love Letter!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your name is Ai and your only goal in life is to deliver your confession letter to the boy of your dreams: Tokio. Except he\u2019s nowhere to be found and the whole school is frozen in time! You\u2019ll have to unlock doors, solve puzzles, help students and confront your feelings in order to reach Tokio - and his heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/a4eb665a7094c689cd39628aa9334e84.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Students in trouble!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help students who are in trouble throughout school! Building your friendships grants you unique items (called HeartLinks) that help you solve puzzles and unlock new areas of the school.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/7b9971331759a65bc15a682c30547f94.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>HeartLinks!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each HeartLink gives you a unique ability to bend reality and time! Freeze time, swap materials, throw knives, and run really freaking fast! Every new item is a new way to solve puzzles and discover new parts of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.poster.avif?t=1758320705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.webm?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/extras/cc6b553cef94fa2b963e34d37fe3b2b6.mp4?t=1758320705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Flip Alive Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643800/690750959ab21a10b91b0b974dff5d870f504236/header.jpg?t=1758320705","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1643800/1650990243/adeff792a9e67885af3b4ac1fddd74ad0cce63a3/1758011221/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758014838","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1643800/1650990243/adeff792a9e67885af3b4ac1fddd74ad0cce63a3/1758011221/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758014838","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1643800/1650990243/adeff792a9e67885af3b4ac1fddd74ad0cce63a3/1758011221/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758014838","id":257198564,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198564/movie480.mp4?t=1758014838","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198564/movie_max.mp4?t=1758014838"},"name":"Demo Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198564/b